## What exists today

| Piece | Status |
| --- | --- |
| `Tril` quantities, matrix products, `Normal` with a `Tril` factor | built |
| Gradients through long chains of mapped nodes (`log_density_ord1`) | built |
| Retractions for every manifold (`retract_flat`) | built |
| A positive-reals manifold | missing: use $\log\theta$ in the meantime |
| Seeded RNG and per-quantity sampling | missing |
| An HMC / NUTS sampler | missing |
| A differentiable Fisher assembly (for Riemannian HMC) | missing: the root is a graph node, but `information_blocks` isn't on the tape |
| An ODE-step operation | missing: compose matrix products meanwhile |

